    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, pick 1 [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) as your Acquisition objective marker until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins.\n\nWhen an **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** model of yours makes an attack, re-roll [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) of 1 if the model's unit, the attack's target or both are in range of that marker.",
